                        |\n| OATH software tokens                               |                                                  |                 |                      | Medium       | Medium        | High             |              |                           |                                 |\n| Temporary Access Pass (TAP)                        |                                                  |                 |                      | Medium       | High          | High             |              |                           |                                 |\n| SMS                                                | Yes                                              | Yes             |                      | Medium       | High          | Medium           |              |                           |                                 |\n| Voice                                              | Yes                                              |                 |                      | Medium       | Medium        | Medium           |              |                           |                                 |\n| Password                                           |                                                  |                 |                      | Low          | High          | High             | Yes          |                           |                                 |\n| One-time bypass<br><br>(aka Temporary Access Pass) |                                                  | Yes             |                      |              |               |                  | Yes          |                           |                                 |\n| (Personal) Email Address                           | Yes                                              | Yes             |                      |              |               |                  |              |                           |                                 |\n| Secret Questions                              