] [[A5 Licenses]])\n\t- [Emeritus faculty update](message:%3CBN7PR04MB4369A8C196DAFE9011CDD84EAA6C9@BN7PR04MB4369.namprd04.prod.outlook.com%3E)\n\t- [FW: emeritus faculty policy](message:%3CBN7PR04MB43699AC4E8FCC02BB0BA9A10AAF7A@BN7PR04MB4369.namprd04.prod.outlook.com%3E)\n- Circa 2024-05-24, the process is still unclear.\n\t- We have a group with the A5 license applied, but we aren't getting consistent requests to add members. I have asked for clarification:\n\t\t- [Re: Emeritus Professor status at GGC](message:%3CB4D969B2-F124-400B-88A7-E30620E53AA1@ggc.edu%3E)\n\n## Notes\n### [[","bookmarked":false},{"title":"GRC - Write GGC Security Policies","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Projects/GRC - Write GGC Security Policies.md","lastModified":"2024-09-17T01:09:34.735Z","tags":[],"content":"---\ndate: 2024-08-21\ntags:\n---\n# GRC - Write GGC Security Policies\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"ITSM - Help to Define ITSM Incident & Problem Management Processes","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Projects/ITSM - Help to Define ITSM Incident & Problem Management Processes.md","lastModified":"2024-09-17T01:09:06.555Z","tags":[],"content":"---\ndate: 2024-07-27\ntags:\n---\n# ITSM - Help to Define ITSM Incident & Problem Management Processes\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"GRC - Create ClickUp Form for Contract Cover Sheet for Vendor Risk Assessments","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/GRC - Create ClickUp Form for Contract Cover Sheet for Vendor Risk Assessments.md","lastModified":"2024-09-17T01:08:48.975Z","tags":[],"content":"---\ndate: 2024-09-16\ntags:\n---\n# GRC - Create ClickUp Form for Contract Cover Sheet for Vendor Risk Assessments\n\n```meta-bind-embed\n[[Project Header]]\n```\n## Team\n- \n## Tasks\n- \n## Communications\n- Email thread started by [[Lindsey Vinson]]: [Contract Form](message:%3CSN6PR04MB4911814BD35B493BABA67A669EA22@SN6PR04MB4911.namprd04.prod.outlook.com%3E)\n## Docs\n- \n## Referenc