","tags":["#2","#3"],"content":"# Values\n*My roles and the values by which I try to live each of them.*\n## Insights & Ideas\n- Don’t  speak of what you’re going to do and only occasionally speak of what you’ve done.\n- [[writing helps you to think|Writing helps you to think]], so value your analog [[Bullet Journal (BuJo)]].\n\n## Plan\n1. Taking care of yourself. Vacation, the gym, playing Zelda, etc. are all part of your self-care focus. Be intentional about making the habits that matter here stick.\n\n2. [[Declare your desired future]]. You are [[aimlessly walking through the mud]]. Declare where you are headed, see the mud getting less deep over time. Pick a destination, and yes, set a date, we talked through the pros and cons.\n\n3. Draft the plan. Depending on which destination you choose, map the plan that will get you there.\n\n4. From #2 and #3, start to bring in the reflection on identity and habit. What actions and habits will support this desired direction you are headed. Including the practices that will serve you as you try to ease slowly away from some of things on the other side of this declared path.\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"2024-06-04 - Tuesday","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Journal/2024/2024-06 - June/2024-06-04 - Tuesday.md","lastModified":"2024-09-10T18:54:57.824Z","tags":[],"content":"---\nperiodicNotes: daily\naliases: 2024-06-04\ndate: 2024-06-04\nprevious: \"[[2024-06-03 - Monday]]\"\nday: \"[[2024-06-04 - Tuesday]]\"\nnext: \"[[2024-06-05 - Wednesday]]\"\nweek: \"[[2024-W23]]\"\ntags: \nslept: 6\nsystolic: 124\ndiastolic: 74\nexercised: 0\nreflection: true\nmigration: false\ninboxTriageAM: false\ninboxTriagePM: false\ncelebration: \ncommunity: \ncraft: \nshutdown: true\nhoursScreenTime: 14.5\nhoursMeetings: 0\n---\n# 2024-06-04 - Tuesday\n[[2024-06-03 - Monday|Previous Day]] | [[2024-W23|This Week]] | [[2024-06-05 - Wednesday|Next Day]]\n```meta-bind-embed\n[[Daily Header]]\n```\n## Bullets\n\n- 06:00 Complete Dai