lease let me know if you approve.\n\n--\nCharles H. Leggett, CISSP\nDirector of Information Security\nGeorgia Gwinnett College\nInformation Technology\n\n### Response #decisions \nNo response as of 2024-07-30 - Tuesday\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Project Statuses","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_OLD/Project Statuses/Project Statuses.md","lastModified":"2024-07-29T11:25:04.942Z","tags":[],"content":"# Project Statuses\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Callout Styles","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/_LifeOS_/_Reference_/Callout Styles.md","lastModified":"2024-07-28T12:48:30.388Z","tags":[],"content":"# Callout Styles\n\n> [!note] note\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!abstract] abstract, summary, tldr\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!info] info\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!todo] todo\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!tip] tip, hint, important\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!success] success, check, done\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!question] question, help, faq\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!warning] warning, caution, attention\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!failure] failure, fail, missing\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!danger] danger, error\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!bug] bug\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!example] example\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n\n> [!quote] quote, cite\n> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"CyberHaven’s Data Detection and Response","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/Technologies/CyberHaven’s Data Detection and Response.md","lastModified":"2024-07-28T12:03:24.691Z","tags":[],"content":"# CyberHaven’s Data Detection and Response\n\n> finds and follows your sensitive data to protect it everywhere it goes, no matter what form it takes.\n\n[Product overview | Cyberhaven](https://www.cyberhaven.com/product)","bookmarked":false},{"title":"“Get busy with life’s purpose, toss aside empty hopes, get act