ere waiting on a call from a \"scheduler.\"\n\t- We called immediately after the meeting and scheduled an appointment with the [[VA Healthcare - Power Mobility]] department for [[2024-01-10 - Wednesday]].\n- This call was scheduled after our consultation with a representative of the [[VA Caregiver Program]].\n\t- We didn't qualify for that program, but she suggested that we may qualify for the ...\n\t- [[VA Homemaker and Home Health Program]]\n\t\t- This program would provide [[Non-skilled Nursing]] based on his [[Therapeutic Potential]].\n\t\t- They would authorize a number of hours (up to 16 max) of assistance.\n\t\t\t- [[Tabia Johnson]], [[RN]] is the coordinator.\n- [[VA Healthcare - Geriatric Extended Care Services]] is also available.\n\t- This program offers adult day-care and [[respite]] benefits for short [[nursing home]] stays (up to 30 days). i.e. care while the rest of the family takes a vacation.\n\t- [VA Geriatrics and Extended Care Home](http://va.gov/geriatrics)\n- We spoke about [[Advance Directive]] and [[Power of Attorney]]\n\t- [What’s An Advance Directive, and Why Should I Complete One? - YouTube](https://youtu.be/bSw13r93Lic?feature=shared)\n\t- Representative is called a: [[Healthcare Agent]], [[Surrogate]], or [[Proxy]]\n\t- The VA form must be signed in front of a [[Notary]] to be valid outside of the VA.","bookmarked":false},{"title":"VA Healthcare - Geriatric Extended Care Services","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/VA Healthcare - Geriatric Extended Care Services.md","lastModified":"2024-07-20T17:46:48.439Z","tags":[],"content":"# VA Healthcare - Geriatric Extended Care Services\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Samsung TV (UN58RU7100FXZA)","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/Samsung TV (UN58RU7100FXZA).md","lastModified":"2024-07-20T11:44:02.633Z","tags":["#Living"],"content":"# Samsung TV (UN58RU7100FXZA)\nin [[1963 Blue Heron Way#Living Room]]\n\n","bookmarked":false},{