urity & compliance related.\n\t\t- GGC licensed M365 A5 for 1,450 users at $85.53 each in [[FY24]]. See [ClickUp](https://app.clickup.com/t/86782pevm)\n\t\t\t- $85.53 * .42 = $35.92 for the A3 features\n\t\t\t\t- $35.92 * .32 = $11.49 for the A3 security & compliance features\n\t\t\t- $85.53 * .58 = $49.61 for the A5 additions\n\t\t\t\t- $49.61 * .81 = $40.18 for the A5 security & compliance additions\n\t\t\t- $11.49 + $40.18 = $51.67 (60%) of A5 license cost is security & compliance related\n\t\t\t- $51.67 * $1,450 = $74,921.50 of total annual M365 A5 license cost is security & compliance related.","bookmarked":false},{"title":"2024-07-19 - CrowdStrike Causes Global Outages","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Journal/_Calendar_/2024-07-19 - CrowdStrike Causes Global Outages.md","lastModified":"2024-07-19T11:23:02.395Z","tags":[],"content":"# 2024-07-19 - CrowdStrike Causes Global Outages\ncaused by [[CrowdStrike]]\non [[2024-07-19 - Friday|2024-07-19]]\n\n[Global IT Outage Grounds Flights and Hits Businesses: Live Updates - The New York Times](https://www.nytimes.com/live/2024/07/19/business/global-tech-outage?campaign_id=60&emc=edit_na_20240719&instance_id=0&nl=breaking-news&ref=cta&regi_id=66710266&segment_id=172576&unlocked_article_code=1.8U0.HKy5.CmOd6jJq3BBK&user_id=2c71e8f3d9b3c5bae97f560683f7cd73&smid=nytcore-ios-share&referringSource=articleShare)\n\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"2024-07-18 - Thursday - Email","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Journal/_Calendar_/2024-07-18 - Thursday - Email.md","lastModified":"2024-07-19T10:37:36.883Z","tags":[],"content":"---\nSeries: \nTopics: \nAttendees: \nSpeakers: \ntags:\n---\n# 2024-07-18 - Thursday - Email\nprevious [[2024-06-25 - Tuesday - Email]]\nnext [[\n\n> [!TODO]\n> ```tasks\n> filename includes Email\n> group by heading reverse\n> group by status.name\n> ```\n\n## Date\n- [[2024-07-18 - Thursday]]\n## Attendees\n- [[Kevin McCuen|Kevin]]\n- [[Noelle]]\n- [[Eugene Horn|Eugene]]\n## Related\n- [[Email Management & Protection]]\n- [[Microsoft Defender for Office 365 (O365)]]\n## Agenda Items\n- \n##  Notes\n- Regarding KB articles and communications on Email Best Practices. (rules, quarantine, junk folder, etc.)\n\t- [[Eugene Horn|Eugene]] says that he has the email rule maintenance KB article written and will share it with [[Noelle Rose|Noelle]]\n\t- I recommended that we remove all [[Mimecast]] references. They all agreed.\n\t- [[Kevin McCuen|Kevin]] and [[Noelle Rose|Noelle]] have a plan to both:\n\t\t- Include this message in future Orientation & Welcome Back campaigns.\n\t\t- Send a one time message via email, and\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"2023-11-16 - Thursday - MS Premier Support Sync","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Journal/_Calendar_/2023-11-16 - Thursday - MS Premier Support Sync.md","lastModified":"2024-07-19T10:16:16.738Z","tags":[],"content":"# 2023-11-16 - Thursday - MS Premier Support Sync\n\nNotes:\n- [[Katie Smith]] is back!\n- Told them that [[Microsoft Unified (formerly Premier) Support]] is up for financial review.\n\t- [[Christine Miller Divine]] has already decided against it, but I asked Katie to put together a pitch for it.\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"62.09 - Activate Microsoft 365 Security and Compliance - Purview Data Lifecycle Management","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/Training/62.09 - Activate Microsoft 365 Security and Compliance - Purview Data Lifecycle Management/62.09 - Activate Microsoft 365 Security and Compliance - Purview Data Lifecycle Management.md","lastModified":"2024-07-19T10:16:16.704Z","tags":[],"content":"---\nTrainer: \"[[Bryan Evans]]\"\n---\n# 62.09 - Activate Microsoft 365 Security and Compliance - Purview Data Lifecycle Management\n\n[[2023-11-07 - Tuesday]] and [[2023-11-09 - Thursday]]\n\nSetup by [[Anne Modest]] funded by [[Microsoft Unified (formerly Premier) Support]]\nLead by [[Bryan Evans]]\n\n\n```ccard\ntype: folder_brief_live\n```\n \