penders]]\n- [[Outdoor Research (OR)]] suspenders\n- [[Alpaka Gear]]\n- \n\n## Main Idea\n- These are not suspenders. Unless you want them to be which is cool (like [[bow tie]]s)\n- Styles ([[Airplane]] reference intended)\n\t- Under,\n\t\t- intended to be worn over [[base layer]]\n\t\t- thin and lightweight\n\t- Over,\n\t\t- intended to be worn over [[middle layer]]\n\t\t- light backpack\n\t\t\t- school books?\n\t\t\t- [[Ultralight Backpacking Gear]]?\n\t\t\t\t- Easy connect to top bar of the [[Arc Haul Ultra]]\n\t- Done (admittedly not a great name, but … the reference!)\n\t\t- intended to be worn over [[outer layer]]\n\t\t- tactical backpack and hip belt attachments (see [[Condor Outdoor H-Harness]])\nOther ideas\n- dump pouch under arm\n## Guiding Principles\n- Don’t sew things together if you can help it and use [[field repair buckles]] if you have to do so.\n## What is the problem that we’re trying to solve?\n- \n\n## How can we solve it?\n- Quick release to swing bag around without detaching anchor points\n- Compatibility with other brands. What does 5.11 Tactical use to disconnect their backpack straps?\n## Materials\nWebbing\n[[MIL-W-17337 Nylon]]","bookmarked":false},{"title":"D3CRX","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/D3CRX.md","lastModified":"2024-06-25T03:21:02.861Z","tags":[],"content":"# D3CRX\nfrom [[Haley Strategic]]\n\n[YouTube](https://youtu.be/PmHLsNuXb-o?feature=shared)","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Alpaka Gear","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/Alpaka Gear.md","lastModified":"2024-06-24T18:20:43.253Z","tags":[],"content":"# Alpaka Gear\n\n[ALPAKA: Premium Bags & Accessories](https://alpakagear.com)\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Arc Haul Ultra","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/Arc Haul Ultra.md","lastModified":"2024-06-24T14:28:19.606Z","tags":[],"content":"# Arc Haul Ultra\nby [[Zpacks]]\n\nSize M torso and XL belt.\n\n[Arc Haul Ultra 70L