e Basics](https://protect-usb.mimecast.com/s/dVpxCN76NnFEWph4ld37?domain=tiaa.org) \n>     Enrolling in USG Supplemental Plans (see attachment)\n>\n> Thank you for allowing TIAA and me to help you plan your financial future.\n> \n> _Click on the link below to find a day and time that works best for you. You will have to log in to gain access to my calendar to schedule a meeting._\n> \n> _Book a meeting with Rebecca by using[this link](https://protect-usb.mimecast.com/s/dDomCOJ0OoC08khkqmkJ?domain=shared.tiaa.org)_\n> \n> Rebecca Jones  \n> Financial Consultant | Client Relationships  \n> **TIAA**\n\n\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"93.26 - 2023 Cubmaster Cut Days","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Projects/93.26 - 2023 Cubmaster Cut Days/93.26 - 2023 Cubmaster Cut Days.md","lastModified":"2023-11-20T17:04:53.000Z","tags":[],"content":"---\nArea:\nStatus: \"\"\nPriority: B\nClosed: true\n---\n# 93.26 - 2023 Cubmaster Cut Days\n## Dates\n1. [[2023-03-05 - Sunday 2pm to 4pm - Cubmaster Cut Day]]\n2. [[2023-03-10 - Friday 5pm to 8pm - Cubmaster Cut Day]]\n3. [[2023-03-11 - Saturday 9am to 11am - Cubmaster Cut Day]]\n## Links\n[ClickUp]()\n[SharePoint]()\n## People\n\n## Reference\n\n## Project Files\n\n## Project Notes\n\n## Communication\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"93.32 - Complete Fall 2023 USG Cybersecurity CPR","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Projects/93.32 - Complete Fall 2023 USG Cybersecurity CPR/93.32 - Complete Fall 2023 USG Cybersecurity CPR.md","lastModified":"2023-11-20T17:04:53.000Z","tags":[],"content":"---\nPriority: B\nStatus: In Progress\nStart:\nEnd: 2023-12-03\nClosed: false\nArea: GRC\n---\n# 93.32 - Complete Fall 2023 USG Cybersecurity CPR\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"90.26 - FY21 Qognify Renewal","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Projects/90.26 - FY21 Qognify Renewal/90.26 - FY21 Qognify Renewal.md","lastModified":"2023-11-20T17:04:44.000Z","tags":[],"content":"---\nStatus: No status\nClosed: tr