fic leadership role or direct contact with youth. The Scouter Reserve (non-unit registrant position code 91) is designed for any adult who would like to be “on reserve” should a Scouting unit need some extra help. The [College Scouter Reserve](https://blog.scoutingmagazine.org/2017/01/19/college-scouter-reserve-lets-former-scouts-stay-connected-to-troop-crew/) (code 92) is designed specifically for college students who are interested in filling that same role. Both require criminal background checks and Youth Protection Training. Those who would like to volunteer as a reserve for specific units can use codes 91U and 92U, respectively.\n\n[Ask us anything! We answer some of your most frequently asked questions](https://blog.scoutingmagazine.org/2022/10/07/ask-us-anything-we-answer-some-of-your-most-frequently-asked-questions-4/)","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Welch Ridge Trail","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/Welch Ridge Trail.md","lastModified":"2023-08-04T10:11:44.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Welch Ridge Trail\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Service Incidents","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/Service Incidents.md","lastModified":"2023-07-31T12:34:43.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Service Incidents\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"2023-07-31 - Monday","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Journal/2023/2023-07-31 - Monday.md","lastModified":"2023-07-31T12:34:39.682Z","tags":[],"content":"up::\ndown:: \njump:: [[2023-07]]\njump:: [[2023-W31]]\n\n# 2023-07-31 - Monday\n\n## Events\n\n\n## Activities\n\n\n## Visited\n\n\n## Watched\n\n\n## Listened\n\n\n## Read\n\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"86.01.153 - Campuspeak Inc. - Speaker Agreement","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Areas/GRC/Risk Assessments/86.01.1XX/86.01.153 - Campuspeak Inc. - Speaker Agreement/86.01.153 - Campuspeak Inc. - Speaker Agreement.md","lastModified":"2023-07-28T12:51:06.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 