unications Conference\") (WRC-15) approved a Worldwide Frequency Allocation of 5.351.5–5.366.5 MHz to the Amateur Service on a secondary basis. The allocation limits amateur stations to 15 watts [effective isotropic radiated power](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Effective_isotropic_radiated_power \"Effective isotropic radiated power\") (EIRP); however some locations will be permitted up to 25 W [EIRP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Effective_isotropic_radiated_power \"Effective isotropic radiated power\").","bookmarked":false},{"title":"86.01.136 - Brightly SchoolDude Asset Mangement","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Areas/GRC/Risk Assessments/86.01.1XX/86.01.136 - Brightly SchoolDude Asset Mangement/86.01.136 - Brightly SchoolDude Asset Mangement.md","lastModified":"2023-06-02T12:44:42.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 86.01.136 - Brightly SchoolDude Asset Mangement\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"83.04.02 - interactUSG","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Areas/Management/Travel, Training, & Certification/83.04.02 - interactUSG/83.04.02 - interactUSG.md","lastModified":"2023-05-30T15:23:49.000Z","tags":[],"content":"up:: \ndown:: [[2023-09-11 - interactUSG 2023]]\njumps:: \n\n# 83.04.02 - interactUSG\n\n[[2023-09-11 - interactUSG 2023 - Savannah, GA]]\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"86.01.135 - Grant Training Solutions - HAZWOPER Certificate Program","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Areas/GRC/Risk Assessments/86.01.1XX/86.01.135 - Grant Training Solutions - HAZWOPER Certificate Program/86.01.135 - Grant Training Solutions - HAZWOPER Certificate Program.md","lastModified":"2023-05-26T13:59:14.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 86.01.135 - Grant Training Solutions - HAZWOPER Certificate Program","bookmarked":false},{"title":"86.01.134 - Oxford University Press (OUP)","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Areas/GRC/Risk Assessments/86.01.1XX/86.01.134 - Oxford University Press (OUP)/86.01.134 - Oxford University Press (OUP).md