  What were your biggest wins last year?\n-   What did you want to achieve but didn’t?\n-   What clarity have you gained over the break?\n-   What do you want to place more emphasis on during the next few months?\n\n[[83.03 - GGC Performance Management]] [[Manager Tools]] [[2018 MOR Associates ITLP]]\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"SCHEDULED","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_OLD/Project Statuses/SCHEDULED.md","lastModified":"2023-01-20T11:54:33.714Z","tags":[],"content":"up:: [[Project Statuses]]\ndown:: \njumps:: \n# SCHEDULED\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"PLANNING","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_OLD/Project Statuses/PLANNING.md","lastModified":"2023-01-20T11:54:16.731Z","tags":[],"content":"up:: [[Project Statuses]]\ndown:: \njumps:: \n# PLANNING\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"NOT STARTED","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_OLD/Project Statuses/NOT STARTED.md","lastModified":"2023-01-20T11:52:38.986Z","tags":[],"content":"up:: [[Project Statuses]]\ndown:: \njumps:: \n# NOT STARTED\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"House Rules","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_Unstructured_/House Rules.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T21:29:14.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# House Rules\n1. If you open it, close it.\n2. If you turn it on, turn it off.\n3. If you mess it up, clean it up.\n4. If you break it, fix it.\n5. If you don’t know how to fix it, find someone who does.\n6. If it is not yours, don’t touch it.\n7. If you borrow it, return it.\n8. If you want to use something that is not yours, ask permission.\n9. If you use it, take care of it.\n10. If it is free, don’t waste it.\n11. If it is not your business, stay out of it.\n12. If you can’t do better, don’t criticize.\n13. If you are not going to help, get out of the way.\n14. If you don’t know how it works, don’t use it.\n15. If you were not asked, don’t give your opinion.\n16. If you make a promise, keep it.\n17. If you say it, mean it.\n18. If you hurt someone, apologize.\n19. If you want something, ask nicely.\n20. If you receive something, say “thank you”.\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"86.01.89 - Adam Matthew Digital Ltd","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Areas/GRC/Risk Assessments/86.01.XX/86.01.89 - Adam Matthew Digital Ltd/86.01.89 - Adam Matthew Digital Ltd.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T19:39:08.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 86.01.89 - Adam Matthew Digital Ltd","bookmarked":false},{"title":"2023-04-22 - NEGA Scout Show","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Journal/_Calendar_/2023-04-22 - NEGA Scout Show.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T13:41:46.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 2023-04-22 - NEGA Scout Show\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Aru Yeleti","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/People/Aru Yeleti.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T13:41:00.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Aru Yeleti\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Jacson Moody","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/People/Jacson Moody.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T13:40:57.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Jacson Moody\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Mina Saric","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/People/Mina Saric.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T13:40:54.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Mina Saric\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Lisa Abercrombie","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/People/Lisa Abercrombie.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T13:40:50.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Lisa Abercrombie\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Owl Patrol","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Areas/Scouting/BSA/Wood Badge/Patrols/Owl Patrol.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T13:35:39.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Owl Patrol\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Hiro Payne","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/People/Hiro Payne.md","lastModified":"2023-01-19T13:27:38.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Hiro Payne\n\n[[Wood Badge]]\n\nDaughter is Ivy","bookmarked":false