\n\n  cp /opt/homebrew/opt/yabai/share/yabai/examples/yabairc ~/.yabairc\n\n  cp /opt/homebrew/opt/yabai/share/yabai/examples/skhdrc ~/.skhdrc\n\n  \n\nLogs will be found in\n\n  /opt/homebrew/var/log/yabai/yabai.[out|err].log\n\n  \n\nIf you are using the scripting-addition; remember to update your sudoers file:\n\n  sudo visudo -f /private/etc/sudoers.d/yabai\n\n  \n\nBuild the configuration row by running:\n\n  echo \"$(whoami) ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: sha256:$(shasum -a 256 $(which yabai) | cut -d \" \" -f 1) $(which yabai) --load-sa\"\n\n  \n\nREADME: https://github.com/koekeishiya/yabai/wiki/Installing-yabai-(latest-release)#configure-scripting-addition\n\n  \n\nTo start koekeishiya/formulae/yabai now and restart at login:\n\n  brew services start koekeishiya/formulae/yabai\n\nOr, if you don't want/need a background service you can just run:\n\n  yabai\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"86.01.88 - ProQuest LLC","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Areas/GRC/Risk Assessments/86.01.XX/86.01.88 - ProQuest LLC/86.01.88 - ProQuest LLC.md","lastModified":"2023-01-13T21:33:13.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 86.01.88 - ProQuest LLC","bookmarked":false},{"title":"2023-01-12 - Employee Corrective Action Notice - Jessica Walker","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_OLD/80 - GGC/81 - GGC Teams/81.04 - GGC Jessica/2023/2023-01-12 - Employee Corrective Action Notice - Jessica Walker/2023-01-12 - Employee Corrective Action Notice - Jessica Walker.md","lastModified":"2023-01-13T20:42:53.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 2023-01-12 - Employee Corrective Action Notice - Jessica Walker\n## FMLA\n- Jessica was out on FMLA for 14 weeks at the end of 2022\n- She didn't show for work on 1/6/2022. Her mom texted me to let me know that she's back in the hospital.\n## Absences\n[[Jessica Walker's Absences in 2022]]\n![[jessica-absences.xlsx]]\n## Team Hardship\n[[Re_ Preserving emails.eml]]\n[[91.34 - Physical Security in the L-Suite]]\n## Written Warning ~~PIP~~\n[Share