ian/TheCollective/Lists/_OLD/80 - GGC/81 - GGC Teams/81.07 - GGC Stacy/2020/2020.10.01 - Stacy Disrupted Team SCRUM.md","lastModified":"2021-11-13T12:19:00.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 2020.10.01 - Stacy Disrupted Team SCRUM\n## Context\nStacy challenged me in our Team SCRUM on the amount of work that I was asking him to do to the point that I had to end the meeting to have a 1on1.\n\n## Feedback\nI am fully open to feedback and honesty, but there is a time, a place, and a way to express your frustration. Ask for help with prioritization of your projects.\n\nWhen you challenge me in front of the group, you put me in a position where I have to defend my role power and push back.\n\nPut yourself in my shoes to consider that and then reflect on how you could handle that differently next time.","bookmarked":false},{"title":"2021.03.01 - Stacy's Accusation of Disrespect and Unequal Treatment","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/_OLD/80 - GGC/81 - GGC Teams/81.07 - GGC Stacy/2021/2021.03.01 - Stacy's Accusation of Disrespect and Unequal Treatment.md","lastModified":"2021-11-13T12:19:00.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# 2021.03.01 - Stacy's Accusation of Disrespect and Unequal Treatment\n2021.03.01 - Stacy's Accusation of Disrespect and Unequal Treatment\n\nDuring the call, he complained that I didn't respect him or  treat him equally to other members of the team (Jessica specifically).\n\n![[Screen Shot 2021-03-01 at 13.14.47.png]]\n![[Screen Shot 2021-03-03 at 11.53.01.png]]","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Jim Bacik","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/People/Jim Bacik.md","lastModified":"2021-11-13T12:18:59.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Jim Bacik\n","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Joko Wilkins","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsidian/TheCollective/Lists/People/Joko Wilkins.md","lastModified":"2021-11-13T12:18:59.000Z","tags":[],"content":"# Joko Wilkins\n[[Extreme Ownership]]","bookmarked":false},{"title":"Maria Hunter","path":"/Users/cleggett1/Obsi